/* The rail's markup, as a string. This is the form a caller composing markup asks for --
 * apps/techstats-island/capture/render.mjs builds its report shell that way -- and it is
 * also the shape a test can read without a browser. Nothing here interpolates data: every
 * value is a constant of this module or an id/title the caller owns, and both go through
 * escapeHtml anyway. The rail this module MOUNTS is built as DOM by renderExportRail. */
